From 9a02a46872831f89c4c9f9394fb0eca140d0e2d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: callan <callanf@nvidia.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:57:57 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 29/38] fix(prefetch): pin the run's ancestors (the chain's
 blocks before it) while room is made and release them after the run, tail
 first, as a request's prefix hit does; unpinned, an ancestor kept its old
 recency and G1 evicted it before the prefetched run below it, so the router's
 indexer truncated the chain there and a later removal failed (kitchen sink v1
 stopped: Failed to find block); a run loads only when G1 holds every
 ancestor. Probe AISIM_CHAIN_CHECK prints the first three G1 removals that cut
 a cached chain, with a backtrace. Unit test

---
 .../core/src/engine/kv_manager/g1_manager.rs  |  4 +-
 .../src/engine/kv_manager/vllm_backend.rs     | 44 +++++++++++++------
 crates/core/src/engine/scheduler/vllm/core.rs | 18 ++++----
 .../src/engine/scheduler/vllm/host_offload.rs | 26 +++++++++++
 4 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

